OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man found at village tip
OL,4,A'not suspicious'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a man whose body was found
OL,7,Fat a waste tip in an East Yorkshire
OL,8,Fvillage is not being treated as
OL,9,Fsuspicious, police have said.
OL,11,FPolice cordoned off a section of the
OL,12,FPocklington Household Waste Recycling
OL,13,FSite on Pocklington Lane in Burnby
OL,14,Fafter the discovery of the body at
OL,15,Fabout 15:15 BST on Wednesday.
OL,17,FIn an update on Friday, Humberside
OL,18,FPolice said there was no evidence of
OL,19,Fthird-party involvement and the death
OL,20,Fwas not being treated as suspicious.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
