OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man found at village tip
OL,4,A'not suspicious'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have since removed the scene
OL,7,Fguard and East Riding of Yorkshire
OL,8,FCouncil said the waste site, which was
OL,9,Fclosed on Thursday, had reopened on
OL,10,FFriday.
